nd isn't counted in \"Total: $60\".\n\nOK let me now refile A with the clean numbers and quote, using the current state. Current main portrait with calc keys; idle budget pill \"Today $0.95\". Open budget sheet → observe → file. Let me first navigate away/back to reset calc keys? Not needed.\n\nTap pill [1]."}
